  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "After Irenea woke up as the chambermaid in a reverse harem game called \"Love or Die,\" she thought she could get back home by seeing every good and bad game ending there could be. But she's still here! So this time, she wants to try leaving the Lavrenti family and the three young masters she serves, but they've all inexplicably fallen in love with her, even though she's just the game's \"Save Point.\" So is the game now making Irenea the main character who has to choose who she loves and who dies? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
